  "proof_summaries": {
    "ModularCurve_CompEq_finrank_adjoin_jBar_eq_dedekindPsi": "For every original nonzero natural level N, the degree of modularFunctionFieldBar N over the intermediate field generated by jBar N equals dedekindPsi N. Original transport through laurentBaseChange and the generic full modular-function-field degree theorem is preserved.",
    "ModularCurve_exists_mem_integers_transcendental_residue_finrank_eq_of_regularProlongation_modularFunctionFieldBar": "For every original allowed nonzero level M, prime ell not dividing M, valuation subring A lying over ell, algebraically closed residue field, and regular prolongation R satisfying the original coefficient residue compatibility hypothesis, retain the original integral element with transcendental residue, positive residue-field extension degree, and equality of the original and residue extension degrees."
